# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values from Supabase:
#   Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API Keys
#
# Both values are safe to expose in the browser. Row Level Security is what
# protects the data, and it is enabled in 0001_init.sql.
#
# Do NOT put the service_role / secret key in this file. Nothing in this app
# needs it, and NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables are shipped to the browser.

